        "raw": "[quote=\"deddragon\"]\n\nThe strictly-about-me part: I&#39;m about to buy badges for the first time in what 15 years? 20? I&#39;m not sure, but I&#39;m super excited!\n\nI haven&#39;t been to GenCon since its last year in Milwaukee, so I&#39;m not registering for any events. Just keeping myself wide open. I&#39;ll also have my 11 year old son along, who may be small but has been the huuugest Sentinels fan for... I don&#39;t know, ever... so we&#39;ll be doing as much Sentinels stuff as possible.\n\nTips and advice welcome.\n\nAnd I&#39;d definitely enjoy putting faces to (forum) names if anyone wants to get together and play a game or seven.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI did something like this as a day trip last year. Alas, I just received a &quot;save the date&quot; card for my nephew&#39;s wedding, which will be the week before. Can&#39;t do both, even flying MDW to SMF for $133 each way.\n",
